
Cenforce 100 mg is a commonly prescribed medication that contains Sildenafil Citrate, the same active ingredient found in the original Viagra. It is used to help men manage erectile dysfunction (ED) by improving blood flow to the penile area during sexual arousal. Taken about 30 to 60 minutes before planned activity, Cenforce 100 can assist in achieving and maintaining a firm erection when there's sufficient sexual stimulation. It typically remains effective for around 4–6 hours. Like all ED medications, it should only be taken under medical supervision, especially for individuals with heart conditions or those taking medications like nitrates. While Cenforce 100 can be an effective support for many men, a healthy lifestyle and open communication with a healthcare provider remain key for long-term sexual wellness.
